%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Mechanic as Mechanic
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as ServiceWorkService
    participant Records as BookingRepository
    participant Dep as InventoryService
    Mechanic->>UI: Record completed work and final inspection
    UI->>Service: Submit service completion request
    Service->>Records: Check required work and completion evidence
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate pekerjaan selesai dan pemeriksaan akhir lengkap
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: consumeServiceUnits(booking)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Mark the service as completed
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Notify the relevant parties
        UI-->>Mechanic: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Keep the booking open when required evidence is missing
        UI-->>Mechanic: Display the reason and required action
    end
